        {
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": "I would never judge you, seriously. That feeling though... when you just miss someone and your brain starts doing that thing where it only remembers the good stuff? It's the worst. What's making you feel this way right now? Did something trigger it or did it just come out of nowhere?"
        },
        {
          "role": "user",
          "content": "help me write it. something that doesn't sound desperate. you're good with words, make it good"
        },
        {
